# Architecture & Refactoring Guidelines

**Extended reference:** [`docs/architecture-frontend-backend.md`](docs/architecture-frontend-backend.md)

---

## 1. Data flow

- Browser: `Component → use<Component> → TanStack Query → frontend/services → Edge handler → @services → @models → DB`
- SSR: `RSC/layout → frontend/server/loaders → @services → @models → DB` (`import "server-only"`)
- Auth only: `frontend/services/auth.service.ts → /api/auth/session` (cookie bridge)
- No domain `/api` routes; no `frontend/services/*.server.ts` domain modules
- Single backend code: `@services` + `@models`; avoid circular dependencies

---

## 2. Frontend components

- Route-scoped components live under the route; reusable ones in `frontend/components/`
- **TitleCase/** folder: `index.tsx`, `use<Name>.ts`, `constants.ts`, `utils.ts`, `types.ts` — no kebab-case files, no nested `hooks/`
- `index.tsx`: UI only — no fetch, Supabase, axios, or business logic
- Pure helpers → colocated `utils.ts` or `frontend/utils/` when shared; constants → `constants.ts`; props → `types.ts` (`interface` over `type`)
- Hooks = stateful orchestration; utils = pure — do not mix
- Prefer relative imports within a route; avoid deep cross-directory imports

---

## 3. State ownership

- Server/async data → TanStack Query (`frontend/hooks/queries/`, `mutations/`)
- Shared client UI (modals, toast, org selection, nav progress) → Jotai (`frontend/atoms/`) + shell `frontend/hosts/*Host`
- Component-local → `useState` in colocated hook
- Global shell modals: atom + `*Host` + colocated `use<Feature>Modal.ts` (Host-only orchestration)
- No domain React Context; no `frontend/contexts/`; only Jotai `<Provider>` in `AppProviders`
- Atoms: small, named by meaning; derived → `atom((get) => …)`; no server data in atoms

---

## 4. Browser I/O (`frontend/services/`)

- Sole domain HTTP layer: `fetch` to `/functions/v1/<slug>` via `EDGE_FUNCTION_SLUGS` / `edgeFunctionFetch`
- TanStack hooks call services only — components and colocated hooks do not call Edge directly
- No PostgREST (`.from`/`.rpc`) in services for domain data
- Exceptions: auth session, Realtime, Storage `File` uploads until dedicated APIs exist
- Import `@shared/dto/*` for wire contracts; Query owns cache — no UI logic in services

---

## 5. TanStack Query

- `@tanstack/react-query` only — never `react-query`
- One domain file per folder: `queries/use<Domain>.ts`, `mutations/use<Domain>.ts` — multiple exports OK; no action-named files (`useAcknowledgeAlert.ts`)
- Queries: `use<Thing>Query`; mutations: `useVerbNounMutation` (slug-derived)
- Query keys + cache/optimistic helpers live in the **queries** domain file; mutations import them — no `*-cache.ts` under hooks
- Mutations: `mutationFn` only — no toasts, routing, or modal state
- Domain realtime invalidation hooks colocate in the domain queries file; cross-domain composers stay thin
- `frontend/hooks/` root: infrastructure only (`query-provider.tsx`, `usePostgresRealtimeInvalidation.ts`)

---

## 6. Supabase Edge

- `supabase/functions/<slug>/` = one deployable function; folder name = slug = URL; prefer verb-first slugs
- Renaming a slug folder is breaking — update `EDGE_FUNCTION_SLUGS`, cron, webhooks, all callers
- `index.ts`: Deno.serve + CORS → `handle(req)` only — no auth, parsing, or domain logic
- `handler.ts`: thin HTTP adapter → `@services/*` + `@models/*` — no `.from()` in handlers
- `@services/_services/{domain}/` orchestration (`{domain}.service.ts`); slug-only logic under `functions/<slug>/` only when substantial
- `@models/<table>.ts` = all `.from("<table>")` for that table; do not deploy table code as a slug folder
- `@shared/dto/` wire types; table-oriented types in `frontend/types/`
- Privileged ops: `createServiceClient()` on Edge after auth checks — not Next `/api`

**Deno imports:** every local import under `supabase/functions/` ends in `.ts` (`@services/`, `@models/`, `@shared/`, relative) — not npm/jsr packages; fix all local imports in any file you touch; `deno.json` import maps are not a substitute

**API naming (1:1 adapters):** slug kebab-case → camelCase at every boundary — `create-shipment` → `createShipment` → `useCreateShipmentMutation`; source of truth: slug folder + `frontend/lib/supabase/edge-function-slugs.ts`; bulk client loops → `bulkVerbNoun`; DTOs keep payload names; no extra qualifiers (`Commercial`, `Platform`, `*Browser`, `*Query`) on new code

---

## 7. SSR loaders & DTOs

- `frontend/server/loaders/*.ts`: thin orchestration → `@services` + `@models`; `import "server-only"`; never import from client components
- Edge contract changes → extend `supabase/functions/_wire/dto/`; do not duplicate wire shapes in `frontend/types/`
- React-only types stay out of DTOs unless they are the wire contract

---

## 8. SQL migrations

- Prefix `YYYYMMDDHHMMSS` must be **unique** — list `supabase/migrations/` first; pick strictly greater timestamp; never reuse placeholders
- Format: `YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_snake_case_description.sql`
- Duplicate applied locally: rename not-yet-applied file only — never rename migrations already in `schema_migrations`
- Changing `public.*` function signatures: `drop function if exists` with **exact old arg types**, then `create function`, then **re-grant** execute; drop all stale overloads in the same migration — `create or replace` does not remove arity changes; fix prod with forward-only migrations (see `20260608120000_drop_stale_overview_overloads.sql`)

---

## 9. UI conventions

- Short UI chrome (buttons, labels, nav, modal titles, form labels): **Title Case with spaces** (`View Shipment`, `Document Type`); document types/groups via `formatDocumentTypeLabel` / `formatDocumentGroupLabel` in `frontend/utils/document-metadata-display.ts` — not raw DB strings
- Sentence case OK for body copy, toasts, placeholders, loading states, `aria-label`
- Tailwind spacing: **even scale keys only** (`0,2,4,6,8…`, `px` allowed); no odd keys (`1,3,5,7`, `px-3.5`, `p-[11px]`) — fix odd spacing in edited blocks; ties round up to nearest even key

---

## 10. Canonical mutation flow (`create-shipment`, bulk import)

Two hook layers — both required for creates/updates:

- **TanStack mutation hook** (`hooks/mutations/useShipments.ts` → `useCreateShipmentMutation`, `useBulkCreateShipmentsMutation`): `mutationFn` only (+ query-cache invalidation when needed). Calls the service; returns data. No toasts, routing, or modal state.
- **Colocated component hook** (`useNewShipmentForm`, `useShipmentDataImportModal`): form/UI orchestration — when to call the mutation, local state (errors, progress, results). Host callbacks (`onCreated`, `onBulkDismissed`) for navigation / toast / modal close when the user is done.

**Single create:**

```text
newShipmentModalOpenAtom → useNewShipmentForm (colocated)
  → useCreateShipmentMutation (TanStack) → createShipment
  → POST create-shipment → handler → shipment.service → @models → Postgres
  → response back to useNewShipmentForm → navigation / toast / modal close here
```

**Bulk import** (results screen before dismiss):

```text
newShipmentBulkImportOpenAtom → useShipmentDataImportModal (colocated)
  → useBulkCreateShipmentsMutation → bulkCreateShipments → createShipment × N
  → response → show results in modal
  → user dismisses → useNewShipmentModal (host) → navigation / emitTrackingCreated
```

Reference: `frontend/atoms/new-shipment-modal.ts`, `components/NewShipmentForm/useNewShipmentForm.ts`, `components/NewShipmentForm/ShipmentDataImportModal/useShipmentDataImportModal.ts`, `components/NewShipmentModal/useNewShipmentModal.ts`, `hooks/mutations/useShipments.ts`, `services/shipment.service.ts`, `services/shipment-import.service.ts`, `supabase/functions/create-shipment/handler.ts`, `_services/shipment/shipment.service.ts`, `_models/shipments.ts`. Full file-by-file trace in docs §11.

---

## Never

- fetch, Supabase client, or PostgREST for domain data in components, colocated hooks, TanStack hooks, or `frontend/services/` (except auth, Realtime, Storage uploads)
- domain `/api` routes; PostgREST skipping Edge; `frontend/services/*.server.ts` domain modules
- fat `handler.ts`, `.from()` outside `@models`, business logic in Edge `index.ts`
- extensionless Deno imports under `supabase/functions/`
- action-named query/mutation files; split domain query files; `*-cache.ts` under hooks; `react-query` package
- slug-mismatched names (`createCommercialShipment`, `*Browser`, `*Query`, extra qualifiers on 1:1 adapters)
- React Context / `frontend/contexts/` for domain UI state; `*ModalProvider` wrappers
- TanStack mutations with toasts, routing, or modal state
- duplicate migration timestamps; RPC signature changes without `drop function` + re-grant
- odd Tailwind spacing; raw `document_type` / `document_group` in UI
- route-specific components in `frontend/components/`; kebab-case component files; nested `hooks/` folders
- inline constants/classes in `index.tsx`; mixing utils into hook files
- duplicating Edge wire contracts in `frontend/types/`
- sequential multi-table deletes in app code when CASCADE FKs should apply (see docs §9)
